// Stormglass Commons Character Appearance H3V.
//
// Four symbolic model-family residents exercise HoloScript-native portrait
// anatomy, source-authored arms-down posing, calibrated skin response, and
// distinct facial silhouettes. The browser witness renders these authored
// objects through CharacterWebGPUCompiler and the native WebGPU renderer.

composition "Stormglass Character Appearance H3V Portrait Anatomy" {
  metadata {
    title: "Stormglass Character Appearance H3V - Portrait Anatomy"
    version: "0.1.0"
    date: "2026-07-29"
    milestone: "MV_CHARACTER_APPEARANCE_H3V_PORTRAIT_ANATOMY"
